    "description": {
      "content": "The Citizens Bank Accounts API enables authenticated consumers to programmatically retrieve deposit account and transaction data for Citizens Bank customers. Designed exclusively for Savings and Checking accounts, it provides structured access to account metadata and detailed transaction histories through a RESTful interface.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Citizens Bank Developer Support",
